# backslash-comment: Does a backslash at the end of a # comment line swallow the next line (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: v@3=2
# pc: ODE0076
# ruling: XPPAUT joins the next line to the comment, so `x'=1` is not read and `x'=2` is the only equation. PhaseCont does the same and warns (ODE0076) with the swallowed line (language.md, Lines).
# a note that ends in a backslash \
x'=1
x'=2
x(0)=0
aux v=x
@ total=1,dt=0.5,meth=euler
